    "dragon_complicated_3": {
      "speaker": {
        "translate": "entity.saintsdragons.ivy_oleander"
      },
      "text": {
        "text": "And he had a really cute black dragon with him. Big green eyes. Almost like a cat. And it moved like one, too."
